# NTS-authenticated time sources (DESIGN-v3 A8/DQ10). Three
# independent operators; chrony needs any one of them for a
# disciplined clock. `nts` makes the NTS-KE handshake (TCP 4460)
# mandatory for the source to be used - there is no silent fallback
# to plain NTP for these names.
server time.cloudflare.com iburst nts
server nts.netnod.se iburst nts
server ptbtime1.ptb.de iburst nts
